<title>USA: BTi delisted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>BTi delisted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biomagnetic Technologies Inc said it received notice on March 10 from Nasdaq that it is in violation of the Nasdaq listing criteria requiring a minimum of $4 million in net tangible assets.</p>
<p>Consequently, Biomagnetic will no longer be listed on the Nasdaq National Market System effective on the close of business on March 10.</p>
</text>
